    },
    "Adds a second chat engine to the agent window and the caption AI tasks, billed by that provider rather than your credits. Works with OpenAI, Azure OpenAI, OpenRouter, Ollama, LM Studio, etc. Image, speech, music, transcription and video always run on your subscription. Leave it empty to use the subscription alone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为代理窗口和字幕 AI 任务添加第二个聊天引擎，由该提供商计费而不是扣除你的积分。支持 OpenAI、Azure OpenAI、OpenRouter、Ollama、LM Studio 等。图像、语音、音乐、转录和视频始终使用你的订阅。留空则仅使用订阅。"
          }
        }
