    "How many times the agent may call tools before it has to answer. Raise it for long jobs; lower it to cut a looping model short sooner." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "代理在必须回答前可以调用工具的次数。长任务可调高此值；若模型陷入循环，可调低以更快中止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of your script must match what the speech service heard before per-word timings are trusted. Below this, timings fall back to whole sentences." : {
