    "Names and jargon this recording uses. Speech recognition often gets them wrong; listing them here lets the AI review find and fix those mistakes, and keeps a term from being split across two captions." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这段录音里出现的人名和专业词汇。语音识别经常写错，在此列出后，AI 审阅就能找出并修正，同时避免术语被拆到两条字幕里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Names and jargon this recording uses. Speech recognition often gets them wrong; listing them here lets the AI review find and fix those mistakes, and keeps a term from being split across two captions. Give a term a translation and every translated caption that uses it follows along." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此录音中使用的名称和术语。语音识别经常会识别错误；在此列出后，AI 审阅可以发现并修正这些错误，也能避免一个术语被拆分到两条字幕中。为术语添加翻译后，使用该术语的所有已翻译字幕都会随之更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
