    "Reviewing keeps the agent from writing caption text directly — it proposes changes and you approve them. Everything else it does (creating projects, editing compositions, generating images) takes effect immediately either way." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "审阅模式可防止代理直接写入字幕文本——它会提出更改，由你批准。除此之外，它执行的所有操作（创建项目、编辑合成、生成图像）都会立即生效。"
